<section class="cc-about" id="about">
  <div class="cc-about-inner">
    <figure class="cc-about-fig">
      <img
        src="/imagery/jacob-tree.png"
        alt="Jacob Vermeulen"
        loading="lazy"
      />
    </figure>

    <div class="cc-about-text">
      <div class="cc-eyebrow">About Jacob</div>
      <h2 class="cc-h2" style="margin-top: var(--sp-4); max-width: 22ch;">
        The teacher <em>and the path.</em>
      </h2>

      <p>
        Jacob Vermeulen is the founder of Somatic Vocal Healing and the
        Sound Constellation method. Over the past years he has guided
        thousands of students worldwide through this work — through
        workshops, the 12-week foundational course, certification training,
        the CEEE program, and retreats in Europe and South Africa.
      </p>
      <p>
        His teaching is direct, embodied, and rooted in his own life. He
        doesn't claim to have learned this from books. He learned it the
        way most real things are learned — by going through it.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
